This is a working _non released_ Art Gallery, door that allows users to
upload, download, and view ANSI pics.  Not quite finished, but works fine
as is.

To compile the source, you'll need SAS C 6.X.

To install it, just use sumthin' akin to this:

  KEY  FUNCTION  EXTRAS  LOW  HIGH   PATH/FILENAME
   R      34       0     10   10000  DOORS:ANSI_ART/ANSI_READER

  KEY  FUNCTION  EXTRAS  LOW  HIGH   PATH/FILENAME
   S      34       0     10   10000  DOORS:ANSI_ART/ANSI_SENDER

With the above installation, the R key will allow users to read and download
the ART Gallery ANSIs, and the S key will allow them to upload new ANSIs
into the ART Gallery.

You'll also need to make a BBS:ART directory into which you copy at least one
ANSI file.  The first time you run the ANSI_READER door from MAXs, it'll 
create an ART.index file that is updated each time a user uploads a new ANSI
file.  

An optional Help.text file may also be written by you and plonked into the
ART directory.


